        "expression": "let base = mix(bg, c4, smoothstep(-0.5, 0.5, p.y));\nlet g1 = p * 6.0 - vec2<f32>(0.0, t * 0.1);\nlet id1 = floor(g1);\nlet h1 = hash(id1);\nlet o1 = (hash2(id1 + vec2<f32>(4.0, 9.0)) - 0.5) * 0.3;\nlet q1 = fract(g1) - 0.5 - o1;\nlet d1 = length(q1);\nlet rr = 0.07 + 0.05 * h1;\nlet ring1 = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.02, abs(d1 - rr));\nlet fill1 = 1.0 - smoothstep(rr - 0.01, rr, d1);\nlet far = c5 * (ring1 * 0.9 + fill1 * 0.2);\nlet g2 = p * 3.5 - vec2<f32>(t * 0.2, 0.0);\nlet id2 = floor(g2);\nlet h2 = hash(id2);\nlet bob = 0.1 * sin(t * 0.9 + h2 * 6.28);\nlet q2 = fract(g2) - 0.5 - vec2<f32>(0.0, bob);\nlet d2 = abs(q2.x) + abs(q2.y) - (0.13 + 0.05 * h2);\nlet fill2 = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.02, d2);\nlet mid = mix(c3, c1, step(0.6, h2)) * fill2;\nlet g3 = p * 9.0 + vec2<f32>(t * 0.35, t * 0.2);\nlet id3 = floor(g3);\nlet h3 = hash(id3);\nlet o3 = (hash2(id3 + vec2<f32>(2.0, 5.0)) - 0.5) * 0.3;\nlet q3 = fract(g3) - 0.5 - o3;\nlet d3 = length(q3);\nlet tw = 0.5 + 0.5 * sin(t * 4.0 + h3 * 6.28);\nlet spark = (1.0 - smoothstep(0.0, 0.03, d3 - 0.03)) * tw * step(0.5, h3);\nlet near = mix(c2, c3, h3) * spark;\nlet color = base + far + mid + near;\nreturn mix(bg, tonemap(color * 1.2), strength);",
        "name": "Pop Parade",
